ARCHITECTURE
    [TYPE]        MVC tradicional con DI Container
    [PATTERNS]    Service Layer, Repository, DTO, Hook System
    [ENTRY]       index.php -> header.php -> bootstrap -> Controller -> footer.php
    [CONTROLLERS] src/Php/ (21 controladores de páginas)
    [SERVICES]    src/Class/ (38 clases de lógica de negocio)
    [UTILITIES]   src/Utils/ (HTTP, Security, Theme, Html, Misc, Media)

SECURITY
    [AUTH]        Basado en sesiones (modo estricto, regeneración cada 30min)
    [CSRF]        Validación de tokens (CsrfToken.php)
    [CSP]         Content Security Policy con nonce por request
    [XSS]         Smarty auto-escape + Html::escape()
    [SQL]         Prepared statements con named parameters (fachada DB)
    [LOGIN]       Throttling por IP (20/15min), por usuario (5/10min), global (100/hr)
    [HEADERS]     X-Frame-Options, X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy
    [PASSWORDS]   Argon2id (128MB memoria, 4 iteraciones, 2 threads)

